> A hand-checkable calculation

Search visits2,3 become policy targets.4,.6. These search targets differ from the network prior. Terminal outcomes separately supervise the current-player value.

```{cpp, results="markdown", file="figures/alphazero_worked.svg", flags="-std=c++23 -O2 $(pkg-config --cflags --libs datamunge) -lpthread -Wl,-rpath,$(pkg-config --variable=libdir datamunge)"}
