> Inspect the native model architecture

The source nine-cell board graph with two ReLU64 layers, nine log-policy outputs and a scalar tanh value. This trace uses an independent store and does not change fitting.

```{cpp, results="markdown", file="figures/alphazero_network.svg", flags="-std=c++23 -O2 $(pkg-config --cflags --libs datamunge) -lpthread -Wl,-rpath,$(pkg-config --variable=libdir datamunge)"}
