> Interpretation and provenance

The retained checks and printed outcomes determine what this run supports. Weak or deferred quality checks are not evidence of full convergence. Native APIs provide pure differentiable model components, owning transitions and cloned-game search; every objective, optimizer, episode/self-play loop, controller search and training schedule stays editable above.

The two evaluation series retain their distinct opponents and counts:40 random-opponent games and20 MCTS(200)-opponent games at iterations1,5,10,15,20,25.
